IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ic-core`
IMPORT `ic6-transitional`

-- Tests of ic6-transitional.l4 (Part 10 and the date of passing). Expected values are written by hand from the sections named.
-- The Ordinance provision is built positionally: its section number, relates to secured bonds charges and winding up, is a memorandum-change provision, is section 115א, is a decision required under the Ordinance.
-- The company's position: exempted under section 32, deleted under section 368, section 24 of this Law applies to it.

§ `בדיקות – חלק 10: ביטול, הוראות מעבר, תחולה ותחילה`

§§ `סעיף 367`

-- Item (1): sections 164 to 201, 244 to 367 and 370 to 382, for any company; the edges are in, the neighbours out.
